"To force the load/linking of your register allocator into the {program}`llc`/"
"{program}`lli` tools, add your creator function's global declaration to "
"`Passes.h` and add a \"pseudo\" call line to `llvm/Codegen/"
"LinkAllCodegenComponents.h`."
